{"proposal": {"tool_id": "L11_client_memo", "arguments": {"matter_id": "MAT-078", "memo_type": "status_update", "content": "This memo provides a status update on the Pinnacle Industries acquisition of DataStream Corp (MAT-078). All due diligence reports have been finalized, and regulatory filings are on schedule for submission by April 15, 2026. We are currently coordinating with DataStream’s legal team to resolve minor discrepancies in asset disclosures. Closing is projected for June 30, 2026, pending no material delays.

